{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25967","headline":"苦哉远征人 · 鲍溶","name":"苦哉远征人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"征人歌古曲，携手上河梁。\n李陵死别处，窅杳玄冥乡。\n忆昔从此路，连年征鬼方。\n久行迷汉历，三死氊衣裳。\n百战身且在，微功信难忘。\n远承云台议，非势孰敢当。\n落日吊李广，白首过河阳。\n闲弓失月影，劳劒无龙光。\n去日始束发，今来发成霜。\n虚名乃闲事，生见父母乡。\n掩抑大风歌，裴回少年场。\n诚哉古人言，鸟尽良弓藏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25967.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25967","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}